Z||000012||Songman||06-11-2001||11:06 PM||||At first glance it does look like a Photoshop job, but when you compare all pictures you can see that it is just a clump of grass growing in front of the car...<P>Personally, I would pass on this. Looks too much like my sister's Mitsubishi... but everyone had their own taste...<P>As for cool Limos.. Once in San Francisco I saw a white 911 slopenose Cabrio that had been stretch to about 40 feet. Even had a widebody and whale tail. After owning 3 911's I can only imagine how worthless this would be as a limo, but it was a cool thing to see... I figure about the same for the Fiero limo...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
